i e l’introduzione di funzioni dedicate ai Mondiali 2026, tra cui Live Activities e Apple News.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Sports-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Sports-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14995,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T09:00:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:57:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"google-prime-smart-glasses-ai-arrivo-questa-stagione-anche-con-iphone\",\"title\":\"Google: prime smart glasses AI in arrivo questa stagione, anche con iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Google annuncia le sue prime smart glasses AI “audio”: Android XR, supporto Gemini e collaborazione con Samsung, Gentle Monster e Warby Parker. Compatibili anche con iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/google-gentle-monster-glasses-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"google-gentle-monster-glasses\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14920,\"date\":\"2026-05-16T09:30:08+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-16T09:51:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"10-consigli-utili-iphone-funzioni-nascoste-ios-26\",\"title\":\"10 consigli utili per iPhone: funzioni nascoste in iOS 26+\",\"excerpt\":\"Scopri 10 trucchi utili per iPhone su iOS 26 o successivo: widget dalle app, cronologia luoghi in Maps, vibrazioni personalizzate e altro.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"catego